 SLA Type 
 &#160; 
 This interface provides the customer 
 support agent an option to create master for SLA type 
 &#160; 
 &#160; 
 Code : Type the Code for 
 the SLA Type 
 &#160; 
 Description : 
 Type the description of the SLA Type 
 &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; 
 Click on submit to save 
 the master. 
 &#160; 
 &#160; 
 Example 
 &#160; 
 STANDARD 
 – This is used to tag problems that do not need immediate attention 
 ENHANCED – This is used to tag problems 
 that need immediate attention 
